---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Research — Salvatore Di Dio"
description: "How design can produce more sustainable behaviour in cities: open questions, research areas and selected publications."
---
{#- DRAFT: built in development only, never in production, until the commentaries are written. -#}
<article class="page">
  <header>
    <h1>Research</h1>
    <p class="lede">One question runs through everything I have published: how design can produce
       more sustainable behaviour in cities.</p>
    <p>I work where service design, social innovation and urban sustainability meet, through action
       research with real communities. The book that holds the argument together is
       <cite>{{ research.book.title }}</cite> ({{ research.book.venue }}, {{ research.book.year }}).</p>
  </header>

  <section aria-labelledby="questions">
    <h2 id="questions">Open questions</h2>
    <ol class="questions">
    {%- for q in research.questions %}
      <li>{{ q }}</li>
    {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
  </section>

  {%- for a in research.areas %}
  <section aria-labelledby="area-{{ loop.index }}">
    <h2 id="area-{{ loop.index }}">{{ a.title }}</h2>
    <p>{{ a.text }}</p>
    <ul class="refs">
    {%- for r in a.refs %}
      <li>
        {% if r.doi %}<a href="https://doi.org/{{ r.doi }}"{% if r.lang %} lang="{{ r.lang }}"{% endif %}>{{ r.title }}</a>{% else %}<cite{% if r.lang %} lang="{{ r.lang }}"{% endif %}>{{ r.title }}</cite>{% endif %}
        <span class="venue">{{ r.venue }}, {{ r.year }}</span>
        {%- if r.note %}
        <span class="note">{{ r.note }}</span>
        {%- else %}
        {% todo "one or two lines of commentary, in Salvatore's voice" %}
        {%- endif %}
      </li>
    {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- if a.frontier %}
    <p class="frontier">{{ a.frontier }}</p>
    {%- endif %}
  </section>
  {%- endfor %}

  <section aria-labelledby="all">
    <h2 id="all">Everything else</h2>
    <p>The complete list of publications is on ORCID and Google Scholar. Funded projects, with roles
       and grant numbers, are on the {% if "/projects/" | hasPage(collections.all) %}<a href="/projects/#funded">projects page</a>{% else %}projects page{% endif %}.</p>
    <ul class="links">
      <li><a href="https://orcid.org/{{ site.orcid }}">ORCID</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ site.scholar }}">Google Scholar</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</article>
